{"id": 4, "name": "Alice", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_34013ffb449baa842122de6126e43259.png", "cls": ["Tank", "Mage"], "specialty": ["Charge", "Regen"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["50", "50", "70", "70"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", "Jungle"], "story": "Queen of the Blood Demons and one of the two dominant powers in the Abyss.", "skills": [{"name": "Crimson Blood Banquet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_156b5e04b84b0c6b88e4b32267fec730.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "When Alice's skills hit, she gains 1 stack(s) of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crimson</span>, lasting 4s. Once <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crimson</span> reaches 2 stacks, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Blood Banquet</span> activates, dealing 25<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> plus 0.5%-2.5% of the target's Max HP (scales with level) as <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby units (hitting heroes with skills refreshes the duration) and recovering 10<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+3% Extra Max HP)</span> HP for Alice every 0.5s.\nWhile <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Blood Banquet</span> is active, Alice gains 8% Movement Speed. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Blood Banquet</span> can deal up to 70(+10*Hero Level) <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to creeps."}, {"name": "Crimson Gleam", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_6a063238228005a9942a1eb7efa6b23a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Alice fires blood energy forward, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. Before the blood energy dissipates, this skill can be cast again to activate <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scarlet Shadow</span>, allowing Alice to blink to the blood energy's location."}, {"name": "Doom Waltz", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_4c7a4bc9cafdc56731b756dc883f4301.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4", "desc": "Alice performs a deadly dance, dealing 350<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+130% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies and slowing them by 70% for 1s. If <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Blood Banquet</span> is active at this time, it also scorches enemies, dealing 300% of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Blood Banquet</span>'s damage and healing Alice for the same amount."}, {"name": "Throne of Ruin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_256a8304f18c293d0edcd6c6738cb3e8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 60", "desc": "Alice surrounds herself with blood, gaining Control Immunity and 50% Damage Reduction while slowing herself by 50%. After 1.5s, she descends with force, dealing 500<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span><span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+20% Extra Max HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to all enemies in range and immobilizing them for 1s.\nWhile charging her Ultimate, Alice can only use <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Scarlet Shadow</span>."}], "builds": [{"lane": "JUNGLE", "winRate": 61.3, "pickRate": 5.97, "spell": {"name": "Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2cd084a2661c121c347facb060a80377.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Tank", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage